{
  "bookId": "rewind-21",
  "id": "chapter-88",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|103|＝按玩家性别变化的敬称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "23006001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "皓太郎",
          "text": "那些家伙，还没有追过来吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23006002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "你是在找米莉姆大人吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23006003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "皓太郎",
          "text": "竟然是突然出现的吗？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23006004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这是什么神奇的能力……竟然真的找到了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23006005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "别再想着逃跑了，除非你想吃哈莉的子弹。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23006006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "皓太郎",
          "text": "哼，竟然还有管理局的人，没想到来的这么快。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23006007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "皓太郎",
          "text": "不过你以为这就抓住我了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23006008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "优纪，一起上。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23006009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "好，这次你可没那么容易能跑掉……唔！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23006010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "飞起来了，有东西吊在他身上，是吊钩！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23006011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "在上面，他准备了逃脱的机关，不能让他跑掉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23006012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "皓太郎",
          "text": "再见了各位，让我们下次有缘再见。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23006013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "皓太郎",
          "text": "……绳子？！什么时候！！竟然在这种地方。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23006014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "嘿咻，我可是等你很久了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23007001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "皓太郎",
          "text": "你做了什么？？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23007002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "没什么，只是米莉姆提前发现了你准备的机关，让我顺便做了些布置而已。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23007003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "哼哼，这是很简单的事情。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23007004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "好强！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23007005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "还有利姆鲁，竟然放出了有粘性的丝，是怎么做到的！？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23007006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那就是属于利姆鲁的特殊能力吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23007007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "没错，算是成为史莱姆拥有的一些小便利。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23007008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "皓太郎",
          "text": "人……人类！？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23007009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "比起看到我，你看到这位|103|好像更加惊讶？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-507",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
