      "title": "幕后黑手·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "23011001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "天王盖地虎。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23011002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "皓太郎",
          "text": "小鸡炖蘑菇。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23011003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "是你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23011004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "皓太郎",
          "text": "是我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23011005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "东西呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23011006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "皓太郎",
          "text": "在这里，我什么时候才能恢复自由。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23011007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "等到BOSS认可你的时候。哦？除了涂料之外，竟然还抓到了新的手办吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23011008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "这次你做的不错，我会向BOSS给你申请奖励。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23011009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "皓太郎",
          "text": "等等……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23011010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "我劝你不要跟过来，如果你不想你在乎的人出什么意外的话……呵呵。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23011011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "皓太郎",
          "text": "……可恶！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23011012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "他们就这样被带走了吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23011013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "那些家伙准备的很周全啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23011014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "可恶，竟然逃过了哈莉的眼睛。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23011015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "放心吧，他们逃不掉的，利姆鲁还留下了线索。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23011016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "唔吾，发光了！！这是什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23011017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "一种隐形涂料，只有用特殊的灯光照射才会显现出来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23011018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "利用这个，我们很快可以找到他们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23011019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "走了这么久，终于到目的地了吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23011020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "还好这些涂料我储备足够，他们应该能够顺着那些痕迹找来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23011021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "让我看看……米莉姆被送去其他地方了，也不知道她会做什么，不过这里是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23011022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "实验室？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
